                    sum_r2_good:            `Defensible criteria, honest truth, planned for survivors.`,
                    sum_r2_leaked:          `Softened the message — the real reason leaked.`,
                    sum_r2_weak:            `Criteria or comms under-designed for fairness.`,
                    sum_r3_good:            `Reset, honoured dignity, mediated and held the headcount.`,
